OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'super proud' of teen who
OL,4,Apassed GCSEs using eyes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mum of a teenager with cerebral
OL,7,Fpalsy who passed his GCSEs by using
OL,8,Feye-tracking technology has said she is
OL,9,F"super proud" of his achievement.
OL,11,FPatrick McCabe, 16, from Cheshire, took
OL,12,Fseven GCSE exams between February and
OL,13,FJune and got the grades he needed to go
OL,14,Fon to sixth form and study A-levels.
OL,16,FHis mum Jo praised his "patience and
OL,17,Fwillpower", adding the exams were
OL,18,Fdifficult enough to do, but "having to
OL,19,Fdo them with his eyes is an even bigger
OL,20,Fchallenge".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
