OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'super proud' of teen who
OL,4,Apassed GCSEs using eyes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrick said when he opened his results
OL,7,Fhe "thought they mixed me up with
OL,8,Fsomeone else", but after double
OL,9,Fchecking his name at the top he "felt
OL,10,Frelieved that all the work I did prior
OL,11,Fto my exams paid off".
